    "document": "Event Companion",
    "section": "Dominatus Event Companion",
    "summary": "The event organiser takes the Warmaster role. At each campaign phase’s opening, the Warmaster may pick its Location card in place of a roll. The Warmaster can direct a player to adopt a different Alliance. See the Muster Armies rules for Dominatus.",
